WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A radiologist studies an image, searching for a tiny detail.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers have added something enormous. Most do not report it.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
This does not prove that a meditation recording improves attention.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Zen12 is a paid audio library, not an answer to that experiment.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before paying, verify what's included, the final price and the evidence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Or try a free twelve-minute routine first.
